      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I hought I'd just leave a comment noting that while it might be tempting for the devs to make this a VRC+ feature, this is very much an accessibility thing. As mentioned in another feedback post, allowing the chatbox to have unique colours to differentiate who is saying what is a basic accessibility need if treating chatboxes akin to captions/subtitles.\n\nPlease do not gate chatbox colours behind a VRC+ subscription. I want everyone to be able to differentiate each other for the sake of accessibility. Thanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
